      "body": "We need to add some logging to the `Client` class. For each request the client makes, we should output a detailed debug message to a logger of some sort. I really like how Tire does it; logging a curl command that you can copy/paste and use directly. Also, outputting the status code of the response would be good, too ...\n\n```\n[200] curl -XGET 'http://localhost:9200/index/_search' -d '...'\n```\n\nNot sure how to handle large bodies and what not. And I don't think we need to log responses.\n\ncc @github/search\n",
